Now ask the next question
If Round Robin only knows:
A
B
C
what if we tell it:
A → 100 active connections
B → 20 active connections
C → 50 active connections
Then perhaps:
new request → B
because B currently has the least active connections.
That gives us:
Least Connections
Conceptually:
                  New Request
                       │
                       ▼
              ┌─────────────────┐
              │ Load Balancer   │
              │                 │
              │ A → 100         │
              │ B → 20   ← pick │
